            "evals": [],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "pass"
          }
        },
        "text": "## Purge and Sanctify\n\nEach time an attack targets an Standard-Bearer unit from your army, if that unit is within range of one or more objective markers and the Strength characteristic of that attack is greater than the Toughness characteristic of that unit, subtract 1 from the Wound roll.\n\nEach time a Frenzy-Pilgrim Swarm unit from your army makes a Righteous Zeal move, that unit can end that move as close as possible to the closest objective marker instead of as close as possible to the closest enemy unit."
      },
      "Swarm-Cluster§Procession of Stinging Wrath": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": []
        },
        "rules": {
          "assignStratagems": {
