          }
        },
        "text": "ZEALOUS PHEROMONE-PHEROMONE-LITANIES\n\nAt the start of the battle round, you can\nselect one of the pheromone-pheromone-litanies listed below. If\nyou do, until the end of the battle round,\nthat pheromone-pheromone-litany is active and its effects apply\nto all **Mandible Legion Infantry** and\n**Mandible Legion Mounted** units from\nyour army.\n\n**Chorus of Relentless Hate:**\nAdd 2\" to the Move characteristic of\nmodels in this unit and add 1 to Advance\nrolls made for it.\n\n**Rite of Perfervid Wrath:**\nAdd 1 to the Strength characteristic of\nmelee weapons equipped by models in\nthis unit.\n\n**Chant of Deathless Devotion:**\nModels in this unit have a 5+\ninvulnerable save against ranged attacks.\n\nRESTRICTIONS\n\nYour army can include\n**Bullet-Ant Invasion** units, but it *cannot*\ninclude **Mandible Legion** units drawn\nfrom any other Cohort."
      },
