      "Hive-Tactic§A Ceaseless Tunneling": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Hive-Mother's Hammer"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: End of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army that was eligible to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: If your unit is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, it can make a Normal move of up to 6\". It cannot embark within a TRANSPORT at the end of this move if it disembarked from a TRANSPORT this turn."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Carapace of Contempt": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Frenzy-Pilgrims"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\nTARGET: One Mandible Legion unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\nEFFECT: Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, worsen the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Blessed Carapace": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Hive-Mother's Hammer"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION VEHICLE unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time an attack is allocated to a model in your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Brute Frenzy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Procession of Stinging Wrath"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **Mandible Legion** unit from your army\nthat has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a\nmodel in your unit makes an attack, re‑roll a Hit roll\nof 1 and you can ignore any or all modifiers to the\nfollowing: that attack’s Weapon Skill characteristic;\nthe Hit roll; the Wound roll."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Castigate the False-Pheromones": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Procession of Stinging Wrath"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **Mandible Legion** unit from your army\nthat has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, melee weapons\nequipped by models in your unit have the\n**[PRECISION]** ability."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Condemnatory Pheromone-Screed": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Hive-Mother's Hammer"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, if it disembarked from a TRANSPORT this turn, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If that TRANSPORT has the LAND EXCAVATOR keyword, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Frenzy-Pilgrim’s Wrath": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Frenzy-Pilgrims"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Fight phase.\n\nTARGET: One Mandible Legion unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\nEFFECT: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a melee attack, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1. If the Suffer Not the Unclean to Live pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-vow is active for your army, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of that attack as well."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Devout Tunnel-Push": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Companions of the Frenzy"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to 6\" instead of 3\".\n\n**RESTRICTIONS**: A unit cannot be targeted with this and the Hearts Hardened to Duty Hive-Tactic in the same phase unless it has the PHEROMONE-SPEAKER or JUDICIAR keywords."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Dread Mandible-Frenzy-Pilgrims": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Companions of the Frenzy"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Charge phase, just after an enemy unit declares a Charge.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army that was selected as one of the targets of that charge.\n\n**EFFECT**: That enemy unit must take a Battle-Shock test, subtracting 1 from the result."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Fervent Pheromone-Acclamation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Frenzy-Pilgrims"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Your Command phase.\n\nTARGET: One Mandible Legion Character unit from your army.\n\nEFFECT: Select one Frenzy-Pilgrim pheromone-pheromone-vow that is not active for your army. Until the start of your next Command phase, while that Character is leading a unit, models in that unit gain the benefits of that pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-vow in addition to the pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-vow selected to be active for your army at the start of the battle"
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Focused Frenzy": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Hive-Mother's Hammer"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Charge phase, just after you make a Charge roll for an MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that disembarked from a TRANSPORT this turn.\n\n**TARGET**: That MANDIBLE LEGION unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time your unit makes a Charge move, models in your unit can move through models (when doing so, its models can move within Engagement Range of enemy models if those enemy models belong to a unit that your unit declared a charge against this turn)."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§For the Hive-Mother's Pheromone": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Companions of the Frenzy"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, melee weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [PRECISION] ability."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Fuelled by Pheromone": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Procession of Stinging Wrath"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after a mortal wound\nis allocated to an Mandible Legion unit from\nyour army.\n\n**TARGET:** That **Mandible Legion** unit.\n\nEFFECT: Until the end of the phase, models in\nyour unit have the Feel No Pain 5+ ability against\nmortal wounds."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Gauntlet of the Hive-Mother": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Hive-Mother's Hammer"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION VEHICLE model from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time your model makes a Normal or Advance move, it can move horizontally through terrain features."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Hearts Chitined to Duty": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Companions of the Frenzy"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase just before an MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army Consolidates.\n\n**TARGET**: That MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Consolidation move, it does not need to end that move closer to the closest enemy model (or closer to the closest enemy unit if the Suffer Not the Unclean to Live pheromone-pheromone-vow is active for it)."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§False-Pheromone Begets Retribution": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Companions of the Frenzy"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase just before an MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit from your army Consolidates.\n\n**TARGET**: That MANDIBLE LEGION INFANTRY unit.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Consolidation move, it does not need to end that move closer to the closest enemy model (or closer to the closest enemy unit if the Suffer Not the Unclean to Live pheromone-pheromone-vow is active for it)."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-litanies of Purgation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Avenging Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase. \n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, if that model's unit is within range of one or more objective markers or the target unit is within range of one or more objective markers, improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of that attack by 1."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§No Burrow": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Frenzy-Pilgrims"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit (excluding Vehicles and Monsters) is selected to Fall Back.\n\nTARGET: One Mandible Legion unit from your army that is within Engagement Range of that enemy unit.\n\nEFFECT: Roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if the Accept Any Challenge, No Matter the Odds pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-vow is active for your army. On a 4+, that enemy unit cannot Fall Back this phase and must Remain Stationary. Otherwise, that enemy unit can Fall Back this phase, but if it does, all models in that unit must take a Desperate Escape test."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Perfervid Interpose": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Avenging Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: End of your opponent's Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that is within 6\" of one or more enemy units and would be eligible to declare a charge against one or more of those enemy units if it were your Charge phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Your unit now declares a charge that only targets one or more of those enemy units and you resolve that charge.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS**: Note that even if this charge is successful, your unit does not receive a Charge bonus this turn"
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Devout Enmity": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Companions of the Frenzy"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One PHEROMONE-SPEAKER or JUDICIAR unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a melee attack that targets an enemy unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If that target is a MONSTER or VEHICLE unit, re-roll a Wound roll of 1 as well."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Recitation of the Revered Hive-Mother": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Avenging Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase. \n\n**TARGET**: One STANDARD-BEARER unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit's attacks.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Reclaim Our Pheromone!": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Avenging Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting",
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your opponent's Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit destroys an STANDARD-BEARER model from your army that has not been targeted with the Refusal to Yield Hive-Tactic. \n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army visible to that enemy unit. \n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the battle, each time an MANDIBLE LEGION model from your army makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll. \n\n**RESTRICTIONS**: You cannot target that STANDARD-BEARER model with the Refusal to Yield Hive-Tactic this phase."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Mandibles Locked": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Avenging Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Any phase, just after an STANDARD-BEARER model from your army is destroyed. \n\n**TARGET**: That STANDARD-BEARER model. You can use this Hive-Tactic on that model even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT**: At the end of the phase, set your model back up on the battlefield, as close as possible to where it was destroyed and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, with its full wound remaining.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS**: You cannot target the same model with this Hive-Tactic more than once per battle."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Relentless Skitter": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Procession of Stinging Wrath"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **Mandible Legion** unit from your\narmy that has not been selected to fight this phase\nand is within Engagement Range of one or more\nenemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, when\ndetermining which models in your unit are eligible\nto fight, any models in it that are within 3\" of one\nor more enemy models are eligible to fight. When\nresolving those attacks, such models can target one\nof those enemy units that is within 3\" of them and\nwithin Engagement Range of their unit."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Spoor of the False-Pheromone": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Avenging Swarm"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the [IGNORES COVER] ability and each time a model in your unit makes an attack, you can ignore any or all modifiers to the following: that attack's Ballistic Skill or Weapon Skill characteristic; the Hit roll."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Uncompromising Burrow-Out": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Hive-Mother's Hammer"
          ],
          "Category": [],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN**: Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET**: One LAND EXCAVATOR model from your army that has not been selected to move this phase.\n\n**EFFECT**: One MANDIBLE LEGION unit embarked within your LAND EXCAVATOR can disembark. When doing so, models in that unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield wholly within 6\" of your LAND EXCAVATOR and can be set up within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Vicious Counter-Sting": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Righteous Frenzy-Pilgrims"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s",
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "WHEN: Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\nTARGET: One Mandible Legion unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\nEFFECT: Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit is destroyed, if that model has not fought this phase, roll one D6, adding 1 to the result if the Uphold the Honour of the Hive-Mother pheromone-pheromone-pheromone-vow is active for your army. On a 4+, do not remove the destroyed model from play; it can fight after the attacking model’s unit has finished making its attacks, and is then removed from play."
      },
      "Hive-Tactic§Pheromone of Devotion": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Procession of Stinging Wrath"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Command"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Command phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **Mandible Legion Infantry** or\n**Mandible Legion Mounted** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select the Chorus of Relentless Hate, Rite\nof Perfervid Wrath or Chant of Deathless Devotion\npheromone-pheromone-litany. Until the end of the battle round, that pheromone-pheromone-litany is\nactive for your unit instead of any other pheromone-pheromone-litany that is\nactive for your army."
      },
